  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Hex Spell. For 10 seconds, target foe suffers -1...3...4 Health degeneration. When Phantom Pain ends, that foe suffers a Deep Wound, lowering that foe's maximum Health by 20% for 5...17...20 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "持續 10 秒，使目標敵人遭受體力衰減 1～4 。而當痛苦幻影的效果終止時，該目標將遭受「重傷」病症，最大體力值降低 20% 並持續 5～20 秒。"
    },
